---
const interests = [
  "Quantitative energy analysis",
  "Electricity market modelling",
  "Climate-related financial risk",
  "Sustainable and ESG finance",
  "Reproducible empirical research",
];
---

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>About | Soha Sami</title>
    <meta name="description" content="Academic background, research interests and professional links for Soha Sami." />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Playfair+Display:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
    <style>
      :root{--paper:#f7f7f0;--green:#234b3b;--light:#e5ebdf;--ink:#202b25;--muted:#657169;--line:#dce1d7}
      *{box-sizing:border-box}
      body{margin:0;background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink);font-family:"DM Sans",sans-serif;line-height:1.75}
      .wrap{width:min(1000px,calc(100% - 40px));margin:auto}
      header{padding:25px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;align-items:center}
      a{color:var(--green);text-decoration:none}
      .brand{font-weight:700;font-size:1.1rem}
      nav{display:flex;gap:20px;flex-wrap:wrap;font-size:.88rem}
      .hero{padding:80px 0 50px}
      .eyebrow{font-size:.75rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.14em;color:var(--green);text-transform:uppercase}
      h1,h2{font-family:"Playfair Display",Georgia,serif;font-weight:500;line-height:1.2}
      h1{font-size:clamp(2.7rem,6vw,4.5rem);letter-spacing:-.04em;margin:15px 0}
      h2{font-size:1.7rem;margin:0 0 18px}
      .lead{max-width:700px;color:var(--muted);font-size:1.05rem}
      .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:60px;padding:35px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
      .copy{color:var(--muted)}
      .copy strong{color:var(--ink)}
      ul{padding-left:20px}
      li{padding:5px 0}
      .links{display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:20px}
      .button{display:inline-block;padding:11px 16px;background:var(--green);color:white;border:1px solid var(--green);font-size:.88rem}
      .button.secondary{background:transparent;color:var(--green)}
      footer{margin-top:50px;padding:25px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line);font-size:.8rem;color:var(--muted)}
      @media(max-width:650px){header{align-items:flex-start;flex-direction:column}.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:30px}.hero{padding-top:55px}}
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="wrap">
      <header>
        <a class="brand" href="/">Soha Sami.</a>
        <nav aria-label="Main navigation">
          <a href="/">Home</a><a href="/research">Research</a><a href="/projects">Projects</a><a href="/articles">Articles</a><a href="/resources">Resources</a><a href="/about">About</a>
        </nav>
      </header>
      <main>
        <section class="hero">
          <div class="eyebrow">Background and interests</div>
          <h1>Working across finance, energy and climate.</h1>
          <p class="lead">My academic interests centre on quantitative energy markets, financial risk and the economic questions surrounding the energy transition.</p>
        </section>
        <section class="grid">
          <div>
            <h2>Academic background</h2>
            <div class="copy">
              <p>I am pursuing the Erasmus Mundus master's programme in <strong>Greening Energy Market Finance</strong>, specialising in Climate &amp; Business.</p>
              <p>My studies bring together economics, mathematics, finance and the analysis of energy-market developments.</p>
              <p>I previously studied economics and mathematics, which shaped my interest in applying quantitative methods to practical economic problems.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h2>Research interests</h2>
            <ul>
              {interests.map((interest) => <li>{interest}</li>)}
            </ul>
          </div>
        </section>
        <section class="grid">
          <div>
            <h2>How I work</h2>
          </div>
          <div class="copy">
            <p>I aim to make each project understandable and reproducible: document the data, explain the assumptions, compare methods against clear benchmarks and communicate what the results mean.</p>
            <p>This website is a working record of research projects, code and writing as they develop.</p>
          </div>
        </section>
        <section class="grid">
          <div><h2>Find me online</h2></div>
          <div class="copy">
            <p>Explore my code and research notes through the links below.</p>
            <div class="links">
              <a class="button" href="https://github.com/soha03" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">GitHub ↗</a>
              <a class="button secondary" href="https://substack.com/@footnoteenergy" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Substack ↗</a>
              <a class="button secondary" href="https://it.linkedin.com/in/sohasami" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">LinkedIn ↗</a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>
      </main>
      <footer>© {new Date().getFullYear()} Soha Sami · <a href="/">Home</a></footer>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
